                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Florida families value and appreciate affordable health coverage.\n\nOver 4.7 million Floridians selected an affordable marketplace plan for 2025. Robust outreach and assistance by Navigators is vital to families so they can evaluate options and choose a health plan that is right for them.",
