                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It\u2019s Save Our Hospitals Week and I am with my good friend @RepMaxwellFrost to hear from local health care providers just how dangerous the Big Ugly Bill will be for patients, families and hospitals across the country.\n\nWe will never stop fighting for you, your health and your pocketbooks.",
