                "quoted_status_profile_username": "JoanAlker1",
                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Congressional Republicans claimed they didn't want to \"take coverage away from children\" during debate on the Big Ugly Bill. Now Trump is ripping health care away from our youngest neighbors.\n\u00a0\nI will intro a bill next week to keep these kids covered despite Trump's heartless and costly action.",
