                "reply_count": 9,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Our children\u2019s access to health care should not be on the chopping block to pay for tax breaks for billionaires.\n\u00a0\nMy Keeping Kids Covered Act would ensure protection for uninterrupted coverage for children until age 6, because no matter who is in power, our kids deserve to be healthy and well.",
