                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "5\ufe0f\u20e30\ufe0f\u20e3 days until the Affordable Care Act open enrollment period for 2026 begins!\n\u00a0\nCall your Senators and House Representatives NOW and urge them to extend these cost-saving policies to lower your health care premiums! https://t.co/s9yw5zQpXm",
