                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "While the GOP in Congress is trying to rip away health care for millions of Americans, don't forget that Governor DeSantis has been preventing the expansion of health care for Florida's kids for almost 2 years. He is also breaking federal law by kicking kids off their coverage.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nHe could easily fix both of these problems and help the over 400K Floridian children who don't have health coverage, but he is too busy trying to get a primetime interview on Fox News.",
